Hi KJ Lim,
To get the gene lists for up-regulated genes, you could try 
> geneList<-which(de[,1] == 1)
## if you have two contrasts 
> geneList<-which(de[,1] == 1 & de[,2] == 1)

Changing '1' to '-1' will give down-regulated genes.

Hope this helps.

